{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/667694-superman-as-an-unchained","id":667694,"title":"Superman As An Unchained","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-16T18:49:25-07:00","id":667694,"title":"Superman As An Unchained","content":"I know it might sound weird at first glance, but it really is the closest fit for an NWOD Supes. He is of alien (Angelic) origin, he has multiple identities (Covers), he is immensely powerful (Embeds, Exploits, Demonic Form), he has a talent for understanding strange technologies (Perceiving Infrastructure and Gadget Installation), he has eidetic memory, knows many languages, displays great control over his signs of emotion and has the Fortress Of Solitude, which is a hard to find secret base (Bolthole). He keeps reminders of his friends and adventures inside, and likes to isolate himself there when overwhelmed by his obligations.<br /> <br /> I imagine that he looks very much the same in his Demonic Form: he has exposed blue wiring and red steel plates pieced together into the form of a very human-like and muscular android. He has the Wings Propulsion, but doesn't actually have wings: his flight is allowed by an anti-gravity field generator or something like that. His cape is holographic, and his S-within-a-diamond symbol is the same.<br /> <br /> I don't know what his entire Cipher would be like, but I imagine the first two keys would be Read Hostility and Clothes Make The Man. The resulting Interlock lets him spot people in trouble more quickly, and negates the -3 penalty to the compromise roll for assuming his full Demonic Form.<br /> <br /> <i>If</i> he has an Agenda, I'd say Inquisitor might work. Yes, I know being prepared for anything is Batman's schtick. However, Supes often feels lonely due to being so idolized and not having other Kryptonians to talk with in most stories. Perhaps that could be interpreted as a desire to rejoin and fix the God-Machine, thus making him an Integrator?<br /> <br /> I didn't give him dots in Fame as Supes, because of the veil over supernatural phenomena that is intrinsic to the NWOD. Come to think of it, Unchained Supes would probably have a lot less spotlights on him.<br /> <br /> As always, feedback is appreciated.<br /> <br /> <b>Virtue:</b> Just<br /> <b>Vice:</b> Reclusive<br /> <b>Concept:</b> Paragon Of Heroism<br /> <br /> <b>Incarnation:</b> Guardian<br /> <b>Agenda:</b> None<br /> <b>Catalyst:</b> Divided Loyalties<br /> <br /> <b>Mental Attributes:</b> Intelligence 4, Wits 4, Resolve 5<br /> <b>Physical Attributes:</b> Strength 8, Dexterity 4, Stamina 6<br /> <b>Social Attributes:</b> Presence 5, Manipulation 3, Composure 4<br /> <br /> <b>Mental Skills:</b> Academics (Journalism) 3, Crafts 3, Computer 3, Medicine 3, Occult 2, Politics 2, Investigation (Forensics) 4, Science 3<br /> <b>Physical Skills:</b> Athletics (Flight) 4, Brawl 4, Drive 2, Firearms 3, Larceny 2, Stealth (Plain Sight) 3, Survival 2, Weaponry (Improvised) 4<br /> <b>Social Skills:</b> Animal Ken 2, Empathy (Motivations) 4, Expression (Ventriloquism, Writing) 3, Intimidation (Sudden Seriousness) 4, Persuasion (Leadership) 4, Socialize 3, Streetwise 3, Subterfuge (Excuses) 3<br /> <br /> <b>Merits:</b> Area Of Expertise (Journalism), Patient, Indomitable, Meditative Mind 4, Interdisciplinary Specialty (Improvised, Forensics), Encyclopedic Knowledge (Investigation, Empathy, Persuasion), Tolerance For Biology, Common Sense, Danger Sense, Direction Sense, Professional Training 5 (Journalist: Expression, Investigation, Persuasion), Ambidextrous, Iron Stamina 3, Fleet Of Foot 3, Fast Reflexes 3, Hardy 3, Demolisher 3, Marksmanship 5, Martial Arts 3, Living The Lie, Resonance Sensitive, Resonance Aware 5, Versatile Transformation, Pusher, Sympathetic, Iron Will, Inspiring, Allies (Superheroes 5, Journalists 3), Contacts 3 (Superheroes, Journalists, Law Enforcers), Fame 1 (Journalists), True Friend (Family, Lois Lane, Jimmy Olsen), Resources 2, Electromagnetic Linguistics, Monkeywrencher, Bolthole 15 (No Twilight 1, Bigger On The Inside 4, Arsenal 5, Trap Door 2, Easy Access 3), Suborned Infrastructure 3, Terrible Form 4<br /> <br /> <b>EMBEDS</b><br /> <br /> <b>Vocal:</b> Eavesdrop, Imagine, Voice Of The Machine<br /> <br /> <b>Instrumental:</b> Call Out, Check Backdrop, Efficiency, Fulcrum Point, Functional Identity, Miles Away, Open Sesame, Read Hostility, Right Tools Right Job, Tag &amp; Release, Turn Blade<br /> <br /> <b>Cacophony:</b> Cause And Effect, Combustion, Cool Heads Prevail, Just Bruised, Knockout Punch, On The Mend, Sabotage, Shatter, Special Someone<br /> <br /> <b>Mundane:</b> Alibi, Authorized, Clothes Make The Man, Deep Cover, Going Native, Homogeneous Memory, Idle Conversation, In My Pocket, Interference, Lost In The Crowd, Never Here, Occam\u2019s Razor, Persistent Legend, Quick Change, Without A Trace<br /> <br /> <b>EXPLOITS</b><br /> <br /> Break To Heal, Behind The Curtain, Context Matters, Devour Infrastructure, Disintegrate, Halo, Incendiary, Raze Infrastructure, Rip The Gates, Terrible Avatar<br /> <br /> <b>DEMONIC FORM</b><br /> <br /> <b>Modifications:</b> Advanced Optics, Armored Plates, Sonic Acuity, Heat Vision (Re-Fluffed Rivet Arm), Tough As Stone<br /> <br /> <b>Technologies:</b> Blind Sense, Clairvoyant Sight, Environmental Resistance, Laser Cutter<br /> <br /> <b>Propulsions:</b> Plasma Drive, Wings<br /> <br /> <b>Processes:</b> Aegis Protocol, Amorphous<br /> <br /> <b>Defense:</b> 4 + Athletics/Brawl/Weaponry<br /> <b>Initiative:</b> 11<br /> <b>Speed:</b> 19<br /> <b>Willpower:</b> 9<br /> <b>Health:</b> 11<br /> <b>Primum:</b> 8","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.co